(7490880, 1192339, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An excellent image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>Your appreciative commenters have already summed it up for me Lydia, as Mark says, ''a masterful job''. I think he may also be right about the under-rated voting, your image is just so convincing and they did not have the benefit of your comments like I do, its a real shame it didn''t feature much higher it certainly deserved to. I love the hand writing except that, the only minor criticism I can make, is the faint line to the right of the g. Yes Lydia, I love your creative crop it works perfectly. Thank you for persevering and doing such a marvellous job and sharing it with us all, I and your commenters certainly appreciated it.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An excellent image that contributes well to the challenge Your appreciative commenters have already summed it up for me Lydia, as Mark says, ''a masterful job''. I think he may also be right about the under-rated voting, your image is just so convincing and they did not have the benefit of your comments like I do, its a real shame it didn''t feature much higher it certainly deserved to. I love the hand writing except that, the only minor criticism I can make, is the faint line to the right of the g. Yes Lydia, I love your creative crop it works perfectly. Thank you for persevering and doing such a marvellous job and sharing it with us all, I and your commenters certainly appreciated it.', '2017-01-07 10:24:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7490899, 1192614, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by NiallOTuama:</b></div><hr/><i> really great stuff. very funny too. enjoying this immensely :) <br/> <br/>can i ask in the top middle, is there a patch of blue, or is it just a darker patch and a trick of light makes it look blue? half way along the image. at the top. just under the frilling. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks a lot, very kind of you :)<br/>Yes you are right, there is a patch of blue there. I didn''t apply the toning at full opacity, so that some colors of the original photos would survive in the final image (even if the effect is very subtle). I thought it would be a bit richer this way.</td>', 'Originally posted by NiallOTuama: really great stuff. very funny too. enjoying this immensely :)  can i ask in the top middle, is there a patch of blue, or is it just a darker patch and a trick of light makes it look blue? half way along the image. at the top. just under the frilling.   Thanks a lot, very kind of you :)Yes you are right, there is a patch of blue there. I didn''t apply the toning at full opacity, so that some colors of the original photos would survive in the final image (even if the effect is very subtle). I thought it would be a bit richer this way.', '2017-01-07 13:10:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7490903, 1192602, 114969, '<td valign="top">This one definitely looks like the real thing, wonderful effect. Congratulations of both the wedding shoot and the ribbon, nice to see everything is going well for you!</td>', 'This one definitely looks like the real thing, wonderful effect. Congratulations of both the wedding shoot and the ribbon, nice to see everything is going well for you!', '2017-01-07 13:19:54.000000', NULL, 0),
